\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs20\b Session Recovery\b0\par
\par
Session Recovery reopens the apps, Explorer folders and browser tabs that were open before a crash, power cut or unexpected restart.\par
\par
The software is provided as-is, without warranty. Use it at your own risk. It cannot recover unsaved document contents, passwords or form data.\par
\par
All snapshots and logs are stored locally on this PC. Review the README for configuration, diagnostics and uninstall instructions.\par
